{"2181340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bright Sudoku", "steam_appid": 2181340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to all the players who supported <strong>Bright Sudoku</strong> before!<br>The new version of the game is now available, and players who purchased the game previously can update to the latest version <strong>for free</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on player feedback, we have removed the 3D mode in this version. (If you still wish to experience the 3D mode, you can continue playing the older version.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>2.0.0 Beta</strong> version, we’ve added the following features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note-taking system</strong> – You can now make notes while solving Sudoku puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hint feature</strong> – Tap the hint button to get solving suggestions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> – A brand-new story experience where solving Sudoku puzzles drives the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved controls</strong> – Gameplay interactions have been optimized for a smoother experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievement system</strong> – Unlock various achievements through story progression.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to all the players who supported <strong>Bright Sudoku</strong> before!<br>The new version of the game is now available, and players who purchased the game previously can update to the latest version <strong>for free</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on player feedback, we have removed the 3D mode in this version. (If you still wish to experience the 3D mode, you can continue playing the older version.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>2.0.0 Beta</strong> version, we’ve added the following features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note-taking system</strong> – You can now make notes while solving Sudoku puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hint feature</strong> – Tap the hint button to get solving suggestions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> – A brand-new story experience where solving Sudoku puzzles drives the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved controls</strong> – Gameplay interactions have been optimized for a smoother experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievement system</strong> – Unlock various achievements through story progression.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Bright Sudoku is a unique Sudoku game, which includes traditional Sudoku games and original three-dimensional Sudoku games. The new 3D Sudoku experience brings more difficult Sudoku problems. The newly added dimensions make Sudoku solving more difficult. Come and experience!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181340/3762f2b7bce4f98cbf47ad5511cf2435547a4428/header.jpg?t=1760223589", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181340/0fc8683ff37f1214bc021ae463fcc1ed9a78dae2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760223589", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2181340/0fc8683ff37f1214bc021ae463fcc1ed9a78dae2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760223589", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-3570<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> gtx570<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "re